                     FREEKB                                                     
           END-EXEC                                                             
                                                                                
           EXEC CICS RETURN                                                     
           END-EXEC                                                             
           .                                                                    
       SEND-LONG-TEXT-EXIT.                                                     
           EXIT                                                                 
           . 
